  "notes": "Mission-control/HUD styling: near-black floating panels (18px radii, 1px hairline borders, drop shadows) over a dark tilted 3D map. Amber/yellow (#fcd34d) is the sole active color — active layer card gets amber outline + tint, toggles fill yellow, play button is a yellow circle, the clock colon is amber. Bilingual micro-kickers pair uppercase English mono (PARISHES, ROAD WORKS, MINI MACAU / ATLAS) with Chinese titles. Numbered sections (01 城市日常, 02 城市專題) and tab indices (01/02). Clicking a station opens a detail card top-left (STATION · 車站, next arrival, LIVE); clicking the clock opens a 'SET TIME' popover with schedule option cards, ±1D/±7D date steps, a heatmap time scrubber and preset times — neither shown in capture. Possible new entry: simulation time-travel control (play a day at N× speed with density histogram scrubber)."
